   "text": "What light are\nyou protecting?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The light has sunk into the earth. In a dark time, dim the outside to keep the inside bright.",
   "source": "commentary/en/36.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "37": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Too many rules at home?",
   "source": "commentary/en/37.json#image.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Family says:\nmean your words.",
    "source": "commentary/en/37.json#image.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Say real things.\nDo them daily.",
    "source": "commentary/en/37.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What will you\nfollow through on?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Wind born from fire: warmth makes the movement. Family comes down to words with substance and actions that last.",
   "source": "commentary/en/37.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "38": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Can’t agree on anything?",
   "source": "commentary/en/38.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Opposition says:\nstart small.",
    "source": "commentary/en/38.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Share something,\nstay different.",
    "source": "commentary/en/38.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What do you\nboth want?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Fire rises and water sinks; they’ll never meet. Fix small things first, and find what you share while staying different.",
   "source": "commentary/en/38.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "39": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Hit a wall?",
   "source": "commentary/en/39.json#image.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Obstruction says:\nask for help.",
    "source": "commentary/en/39.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "The wall is\nthe lesson.",
    "source": "commentary/en/39.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "Who could you\nask?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Water on a mountain can’t flow. The old text says turn inward and find the great person: the obstacle tests whether you’ll ask.",
   "source": "commentary/en/39.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "40": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "The pressure’s finally off?",
   "source": "commentary/en/40.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Deliverance says:\nact or rest.",
    "source": "commentary/en/40.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Then let the\ngrudges go.",
    "source": "commentary/en/40.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What can you\nforgive?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Thunder and rain clear the air: if there’s work, do it now; if not, go home. Don’t carry grudges into the next round.",
   "source": "commentary/en/40.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "41": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Having less than before?",
   "source": "commentary/en/41.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Decrease says:\ngive what fits.",
    "source": "commentary/en/41.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Cut the anger,\ncut the wants.",
    "source": "commentary/en/41.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What can you\nlet go of?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The old text asks for two small bowls, not a grand offering: when you have less, bring less. Anger and wanting cost the most.",
   "source": "commentary/en/41.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "42": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Door’s open, still hesitating?",
   "source": "commentary/en/42.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Increase says:\ngo now.",
    "source": "commentary/en/42.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "See good, move\ntoward it.",
    "source": "commentary/en/42.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What will you\nfix today?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Wind and thunder feed each other. The method of increase: see good, move toward it; see a fault, fix it.",
   "source": "commentary/en/42.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "43": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Ready to call something out?",
   "source": "commentary/en/43.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Breakthrough:\nsay it openly.",
    "source": "commentary/en/43.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Speak up, but\nno force.",
    "source": "commentary/en/43.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What needs\nsaying out loud?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The rules in the text: announce it publicly, warn your own people first, and don’t use force. Fight darkness with a sword and you join it.",
   "source": "commentary/en/43.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "44": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Something shiny just showed up?",
   "source": "commentary/en/44.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Coming to Meet\nsays: be wary.",
    "source": "commentary/en/44.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Charm can be\nthe warning.",
    "source": "commentary/en/44.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What’s too good\nto be true?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Wind under heaven reaches everywhere. When something slips in looking wonderful, don’t chase it; send your own message just as far.",
   "source": "commentary/en/44.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "45": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Bringing people together?",
   "source": "commentary/en/45.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Gathering says:\nshare a purpose.",
    "source": "commentary/en/45.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "And plan for\nthe friction.",
    "source": "commentary/en/45.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What holds your\ngroup together?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The king goes to the temple first, because a gathering without a shared center is just a crowd. Where people collect, friction follows.",
   "source": "commentary/en/45.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "46": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Growing slower than you want?",
   "source": "commentary/en/46.json#image.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Pushing Upward:\ndon’t worry.",
    "source": "commentary/en/46.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Small steps,\npiled up.",
    "source": "commentary/en/46.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What can you add\ntoday?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "A tree pushes up through the earth, going around the rock instead of jumping. It’s already growing, so stop braking.",
   "source": "commentary/en/46.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "47": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Speaking up and nobody listens?",
   "source": "commentary/en/47.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Oppression says:\nhold your purpose.",
    "source": "commentary/en/47.json#image.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Words fail here.\nActions don’t.",
    "source": "commentary/en/47.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What’s worth\neverything?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The image is a lake with no water: the container is there, the water is gone. The text says stake your life on your purpose.",
   "source": "commentary/en/47.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "48": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Good things just out of reach?",
   "source": "commentary/en/48.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Well says:\nlengthen the rope.",
    "source": "commentary/en/48.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "The water is\nalways there.",
    "source": "commentary/en/48.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What’s cutting\nyour rope short?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The town changes; the well doesn’t, and the water is always there. What fails is a rope that’s too short or a bucket that breaks.",
   "source": "commentary/en/48.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "49": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Making a big change nobody believes in?",
   "source": "commentary/en/49.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Revolution says:\nfinish first.",
    "source": "commentary/en/49.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Trust comes on\nthe last day.",
    "source": "commentary/en/49.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What change are\nyou making?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Fire inside a lake, and the response is to set the calendar: name when one season ends and the next begins. People believe it once it’s done.",
   "source": "commentary/en/49.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "50": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Got the ingredients, not the result?",
   "source": "commentary/en/50.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Caldron says:\nset it right.",
    "source": "commentary/en/50.json#image.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "In goes raw,\nout comes food.",
    "source": "commentary/en/50.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What are you\ncooking up?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Wood feeds fire under the caldron, and it only works if it stands level. Get your position right before you start.",
   "source": "commentary/en/50.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "53": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Tempted to skip steps?",
   "source": "commentary/en/53.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Development says:\ngo step by step.",
    "source": "commentary/en/53.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Slow growth\nlasts.",
    "source": "commentary/en/53.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "Which step are\nyou skipping?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "A tree on a mountain grows slowly where everyone can see it. Every shortcut here goes the wrong way.",
   "source": "commentary/en/53.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "54": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "No power, no way out?",
   "source": "commentary/en/54.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Marrying Maiden:\nsee the end.",
    "source": "commentary/en/54.json#image.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "This part\nwon’t last.",
    "source": "commentary/en/54.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "How does this\nend well?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The harshest judgment in the book: nothing is supported. The image is thunder stirring the lake’s surface while the depths stay still, so look past the middle to the end.",
   "source": "commentary/en/54.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "55": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "At your peak and worried?",
   "source": "commentary/en/55.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Abundance says:\ndon’t worry.",
    "source": "commentary/en/55.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Be the sun\nat noon.",
    "source": "commentary/en/55.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What will you\ndecide now?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The sun at noon is about to set, and the text still says don’t worry. Waste noon worrying about the afternoon and you never have a noon.",
   "source": "commentary/en/55.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "56": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Somewhere new, feeling out of place?",
   "source": "commentary/en/56.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Wanderer says:\nkeep it brief.",
    "source": "commentary/en/56.json#image.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "You’re a guest.\nAct like one.",
    "source": "commentary/en/56.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "Where are you\na guest?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Fire on a mountain is bright, seen, and moving on. The traveler gets small wins, so be clear, careful, brief.",
   "source": "commentary/en/56.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "59": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "People drifting apart?",
   "source": "commentary/en/59.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Dispersion says:\nmelt the ice.",
    "source": "commentary/en/59.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Remind them where\nthey come from.",
    "source": "commentary/en/59.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What do you\nall share?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Wind over water scatters the surface, and the old kings built temples. When people fly apart, a shared center pulls them back; force only exhausts you.",
   "source": "commentary/en/59.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "60": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Saying yes to everything?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Limitation says:\nset limits.",
    "source": "commentary/en/60.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Firm, but\nnot bitter.",
    "source": "commentary/en/60.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "Where’s your\nlimit?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "A lake holds only so much water, and that’s what makes it a lake. Limits work; harsh limits break.",
   "source": "commentary/en/60.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "61": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Can’t get through to someone?",
   "source": "commentary/en/61.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Inner Truth says:\nbe sincere.",
    "source": "commentary/en/61.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Real sincerity\nreaches anyone.",
    "source": "commentary/en/61.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "Who needs the\nreal you?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The old text says inner truth reaches even pigs and fishes. If your sincerity only convinces the convinced, it hasn’t been tested.",
   "source": "commentary/en/61.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "62": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Aiming too high right now?",
   "source": "commentary/en/62.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Small things: yes.\nBig things: no.",
    "source": "commentary/en/62.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Fly low,\nnot high.",
    "source": "commentary/en/62.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What small thing\ncan you do?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The bird’s message comes from below: descend, don’t climb. The only excess allowed is more humble, more careful, more frugal.",
   "source": "commentary/en/62.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "63": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Just finished something big?",
   "source": "commentary/en/63.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Completion says:\nstay alert.",
    "source": "commentary/en/63.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Prepare now,\nwhile it works.",
    "source": "commentary/en/63.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What could\ngo wrong?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "Water over fire, in balance for now, and the text warns: good start, messy end. Think about what can go wrong while it still works.",
   "source": "commentary/en/63.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "64": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "So close to done?",
   "source": "commentary/en/64.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Before Completion:\nnot yet.",
    "source": "commentary/en/64.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Sort things out\nbefore you move.",
    "source": "commentary/en/64.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What goes\nwhere?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "caption": {
   "text": "The book’s last hexagram is a little fox that gets its tail wet just before the far bank. Sixty-four hexagrams, and the last word is: not yet.",
   "source": "commentary/en/64.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 }
}
